    {"id":"master.wallachia.skill.ascension","aliases":["ascension"],"legacyId":"ascension","name":"不休梦魇","cardType":"master_skill","owner":{"type":"master","id":"master.wallachia"},"printedText":"（此牌加入你的技能区。）此牌需追加打出。\n唯一/打出时：将你技能区其他所有的【不休梦魇】移除游戏。\n打出时：将一张此牌的复制加入你的技能区。","cardFace":{"typeLabel":"升华技","attributes":[],"cost":0,"basePower":0},"playTiming":{"phase":"action","window":"controller_play_card_window"},"playRequirements":[],"abilities":[{"id":"wallachia.nightmare","kind":"passive","printedClause":"（此牌加入你的技能区。）此牌需追加打出。\n唯一/打出时：将你技能区其他所有的【不休梦魇】移除游戏。\n打出时：将一张此牌的复制加入你的技能区。","activation":{"trigger":"while_active"},"effects":[{"type":"record_master_directive","directive":"wallachia_nightmare_lifecycle"}],"execution":{"mode":"automatic"}}],"verification":{"implementationStatus":"host_adjudicated"}},
    {"id":"master.wallachia.skill.s1","aliases":["s1"],"legacyId":"s1","name":"恐惧化身","cardType":"master_skill","owner":{"type":"master","id":"master.wallachia"},"printedText":"当你于每回合第一次进入战场时，在此战场加入一张临时的【塔塔利】事件牌。\n行动阶段：花费3点魔力并选择一名对手，当其位于【塔塔利】所在的地点时，你于本回合打出的攻击获得其从者恐惧的属性。","cardFace":{"typeLabel":"被动","attributes":[],"cost":0,"basePower":0},"playTiming":{"phase":"action","window":"controller_play_card_window"},"playRequirements":[],"abilities":[{"id":"wallachia.fear-incarnate","kind":"passive","printedClause":"当你于每回合第一次进入战场时，在此战场加入一张临时的【塔塔利】事件牌。\n行动阶段：花费3点魔力并选择一名对手，当其位于【塔塔利】所在的地点时，你于本回合打出的攻击获得其从者恐惧的属性。","activation":{"trigger":"while_active"},"effects":[{"type":"record_master_directive","directive":"wallachia_fear_incarnate_tatari_entry_and_fear_attack"}],"execution":{"mode":"automatic"}}],"verification":{"implementationStatus":"host_adjudicated"}},
    {"id":"master.wallachia.skill.s2","aliases":["s2"],"legacyId":"s2","name":"恐惧","cardType":"master_skill","owner":{"type":"master","id":"master.wallachia"},"printedText":"其他对手的从者恐惧力量、敏捷或魔术属性——根据他们游戏开始时牌库中上述三种属性的牌最少的一个。若相同，则为基本威力之和最少的一种。若仍相同，则以魔术>力量>迅捷的顺序排列。你知晓其他从者恐惧的属性。","cardFace":{"typeLabel":"被动","attributes":[],"cost":0,"basePower":0},"playTiming":{"phase":"action","window":"controller_play_card_window"},"playRequirements":[],"abilities":[{"id":"wallachia.fear","kind":"passive","printedClause":"其他对手的从者恐惧力量、敏捷或魔术属性——根据他们游戏开始时牌库中上述三种属性的牌最少的一个。若相同，则为基本威力之和最少的一种。若仍相同，则以魔术>力量>迅捷的顺序排列。你知晓其他从者恐惧的属性。","activation":{"trigger":"while_active"},"effects":[{"type":"record_master_directive","directive":"wallachia_fear_attribute_selection"}],"execution":{"mode":"automatic"}}],"verification":{"implementationStatus":"host_adjudicated"}},
